  "rationale": "Wrap SQL statements with text() and convert mapping results to plain dicts ordered by id. The existing transaction preserves prior rows, accepts empty batches, and rolls back all batch writes on a NOT NULL violation; dependency pins remain unchanged.",
  "files": [
